WEBVTT

00:00:00.685 --> 00:00:01.770
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:03.570
Luke Skywalker and Han Solo

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.030
rescue the princess, destroy the Death Star,

00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:08.707
but their story didn't end there.

00:00:08.707 --> 00:00:12.048
(upbeat music)

00:00:12.048 --> 00:00:14.631
(loud booming)

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.220
Now, the creators of the biggest smash hit of all time,

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:23.057
bring you the next episode in the "Star Wars" saga,

00:00:23.057 --> 00:00:25.877
"The Empire Strikes Back."

00:00:26.764 --> 00:00:27.989
(Chewy growling)

00:00:27.989 --> 00:00:30.198
(guns firing)

00:00:30.198 --> 00:00:33.448
(loud bomb exploding)

00:00:35.978 --> 00:00:38.700
The continuing story of our band of heroes.

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:40.933
Luke Skywalker, Princess Leia,

00:00:42.658 --> 00:00:44.360
Han Solo, C3PO,

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.780
R2D2 and Chewbacca

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:50.333
and introducing Lando Calrissian.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.512
It's an epic of romance.

00:00:53.512 --> 00:00:56.095
(upbeat music)

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.147
Of heroes and villains.

00:01:04.147 --> 00:01:06.897
(Chewy growling)

00:01:09.616 --> 00:01:12.616
(electronic noises)

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:17.425
They cross trackless voids to unknown worlds.

00:01:17.425 --> 00:01:20.401
(upbeat music)

00:01:20.401 --> 00:01:23.234
(loud screeching)

00:01:25.659 --> 00:01:26.800
(loud booming)

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:29.970
A galactic odyssey against oppression.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:32.037
(loud smashing)

00:01:32.037 --> 00:01:34.620
(upbeat music)

00:01:43.020 --> 00:01:47.317
A big new sprawling space adventure in the "Star Wars" saga,

00:01:47.317 --> 00:01:49.549
"The Empire Strikes Back."

00:01:49.549 --> 00:01:52.299
(loud explosion)

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:57.773
Coming to your galaxy <b>next summer</b>.

00:01:58.716 --> 00:02:02.049
(Darth Vader breathing)